@startuml MyBatis-Architecture-Overview

title MyBatis 整体架构时序图（模块协作）

actor 开发者 as User

box "客户端层-用户代码" #LightBlue
    participant ":User Code" as UserCode
    participant ":Mapper Interface" as MapperInterface
end box

box "核心层-MyBatis核心API" #LightYellow
    participant ":SqlSession" as SqlSession
    participant ":Configuration" as Config
    participant ":MapperRegistry" as MapperRegistry
    participant ":MapperProxy" as MapperProxy
end box

box "执行器层-SQL执行与缓存" #LightGreen
    participant ":CachingExecutor" as CachingExec
    participant ":BaseExecutor" as BaseExec
    participant ":SimpleExecutor" as SimpleExec
    participant ":BatchExecutor" as BatchExec
    participant ":ReuseExecutor" as ReuseExec
end box

box "语句层-SQL语句处理" #LightCoral
    participant ":StatementHandler" as StatementHandler
    participant ":ParameterHandler" as ParamHandler
    participant ":ResultSetHandler" as ResultSetHandler
    participant ":SqlSource" as SqlSource
end box

box "JDBC层-数据库交互" #LightGray
    participant ":Connection" as Connection
    participant ":PreparedStatement" as PS
    participant ":ResultSet" as RS
    participant ":Transaction" as Transaction
end box

box "缓存层-二级缓存" #LightPink
    participant ":TransactionalCacheManager" as TCM
    participant ":PerpetualCache" as PerpetualCache
    participant ":Cache" as SecondCache
end box

note over User, MapperProxy
  ★ 获取Mapper过程:
  开发者调用sqlSession.getMapper()
  MyBatis创建Mapper接口的代理对象
end note

== 1. 获取Mapper（初始化/首次使用）==

User -> SqlSession: getMapper(UserMapper.class)
note right of SqlSession
  获取Mapper接口的实例
end note

SqlSession -> Config: getMapper(type, sqlSession)
note right of Config
  委托Configuration处理
end note

Config -> MapperRegistry: getMapper(type)
note right of MapperRegistry
  从MapperRegistry获取
end note

MapperRegistry -> MapperProxy: newInstance(sqlSession)
note right of MapperProxy
  创建MapperProxy
  (JDK动态代理)
end note

MapperProxy --> SqlSession: MapperProxy
SqlSession --> UserCode: MapperProxy

note right of UserCode
  返回代理对象
  实际调用时拦截
end note

== 2. 执行查询（完整流程）==

UserCode -> MapperProxy: userMapper.selectUserById(1)
note right of UserCode
  调用Mapper接口方法
end note

activate MapperProxy

MapperProxy -> MapperProxy: invoke(method, args)
note right of MapperProxy
  拦截方法调用
end note

alt 调用Object方法
    MapperProxy -> MapperProxy: 直接调用
else 调用Mapper方法
    MapperProxy -> MapperMethod: execute(sqlSession, args)
    note right of MapperProxy
      创建MapperMethod并执行
    end note

    activate MapperMethod

    alt SELECT查询
        MapperMethod -> SqlSession: selectOne(statement, param)
        activate SqlSession

        SqlSession -> Config: getMappedStatement(statementId)
        note right of Config
          获取MappedStatement
          包含SQL、映射配置等
        end note

        Config --> SqlSession: MappedStatement

        SqlSession -> CachingExec: query(ms, param, rowBounds, handler)
        activate CachingExec

        alt 二级缓存处理
            CachingExec -> TCM: getObject(cache, key)
            TCM -> PerpetualCache: getObject(key)
            TCM --> CachingExec: cachedList

            alt 缓存命中
                CachingExec --> SqlSession: cachedList
                note right of SqlSession
                  直接返回缓存
                end note
            else 缓存未命中
                CachingExec -> BaseExec: query(...)
                activate BaseExec

                alt 一级缓存处理
                    BaseExec -> BaseExec: localCache.getObject(key)

                    alt 命中
                        BaseExec --> CachingExec: cachedList
                    else 未命中
                        BaseExec -> SimpleExec: doQuery(...)
                        activate SimpleExec

                        SimpleExec -> StatementHandler: prepare(connection)
                        note right of StatementHandler
                          创建PreparedStatement
                        end note

                        StatementHandler -> Connection: prepareStatement(sql)
                        Connection --> StatementHandler: PS

                        StatementHandler -> ParamHandler: setParameters(PS)
                        note right of ParamHandler
                          设置SQL参数
                          #{}参数绑定
                        end note

                        ParamHandler -> PS: setXXX(...)

                        StatementHandler -> ResultSetHandler: handleResultSets(PS)
                        activate ResultSetHandler

                        ResultSetHandler -> RS: next()
                        ResultSetHandler -> ResultSetHandler: mapResult(rs)
                        note right of ResultSetHandler
                          映射ResultSet到Java对象
                        end note

                        ResultSetHandler --> SimpleExec: resultList
                        deactivate ResultSetHandler

                        SimpleExec -> BaseExec: resultList
                        deactivate SimpleExec

                        BaseExec -> PerpetualCache: putObject(key, resultList)
                        note right of BaseExec
                          放入一级缓存
                        end note

                        BaseExec --> CachingExec: resultList
                    end
                end

                CachingExec -> TCM: putObject(cache, resultList)
                note right of CachingExec
                  放入二级缓存
                  事务提交后生效
                end note

                CachingExec --> SqlSession: resultList
                deactivate BaseExec
            end
        end

        SqlSession --> MapperMethod: result
        deactivate CachingExec
        deactivate SqlSession

        MapperMethod --> MapperProxy: returnValue
        deactivate MapperMethod
    end
end

MapperProxy --> UserCode: returnValue
deactivate MapperProxy

== 3. 执行增删改（更新操作）==

UserCode -> MapperProxy: userMapper.insertUser(user)
activate MapperProxy

MapperProxy -> MapperMethod: execute(sqlSession, user)
activate MapperMethod

alt INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE
    MapperMethod -> SqlSession: update(statement, param)
    activate SqlSession

    SqlSession -> CachingExecutor: update(ms, param)
    activate CachingExecutor

    CachingExecutor -> CachingExecutor: flushCacheIfRequired(ms)
    note right of CachingExecutor
      检查是否需要刷新缓存
    end note

    alt 需要刷新
        CachingExecutor -> TCM: clear(cache)
    end

    CachingExecutor -> BaseExecutor: update(ms, param)
    activate BaseExecutor

    BaseExecutor -> BaseExecutor: clearLocalCache()
    note right of BaseExecutor
      清空一级缓存
    end note

    BaseExecutor -> SimpleExec: doUpdate(ms, param)
    activate SimpleExec

    SimpleExec -> StatementHandler: update(ps)
    StatementHandler -> PS: execute()

    PS -> StatementHandler: updateCount

    StatementHandler -> KeyGenerator: processAfter(...)
    note right of StatementHandler
      处理主键生成
      如自增ID
    end note

    BaseExecutor --> CachingExecutor: rows
    deactivate BaseExecutor

    CachingExecutor --> SqlSession: rows
    deactivate CachingExecutor

    SqlSession --> MapperMethod: rows
    deactivate SqlSession

    MapperMethod --> MapperProxy: returnValue
    deactivate MapperMethod
end

MapperProxy --> UserCode: returnValue
deactivate MapperProxy

== 4. 事务提交流程 ==

UserCode -> SqlSession: commit()
SqlSession -> CachingExecutor: commit(required)
activate CachingExecutor

CachingExecutor -> BaseExecutor: commit(required)
activate BaseExecutor

BaseExecutor -> Transaction: commit()
note right of BaseExecutor
  提交数据库事务
end note

BaseExecutor --> CachingExecutor: void
deactivate BaseExecutor

CachingExecutor -> TCM: commit()
activate TCM
TCM -> SecondCache: flush()
note right of TCM
  将pending队列
  写入二级缓存
end note
deactivate TCM

CachingExecutor --> SqlSession: void
deactivate CachingExecutor

note over UserCode, SecondCache
  ★ MyBatis分层架构:

  【客户端层】 - 开发者代码
     ↓
  【核心API层】 - SqlSession/Configuration
     ↓
  【执行器层】 - Executor (缓存管理)
     ↓
  【语句处理层】 - StatementHandler
     ↓
  【JDBC层】 - JDBC API
     ↓
  【数据库】 - MySQL/Oracle等

  ★ 核心流程:
  1. getMapper() → 创建代理对象
  2. 方法调用 → invoke() 拦截
  3. SqlSession → 执行器
  4. Executor → 语句处理
  5. JDBC → 数据库
  6. ResultSetHandler → 返回结果
end note

@enduml
